SNOW SERPENT.

1ST TROOP'S INITIAL TARGET ZONE LIES ON A COURSE HEADING EAST 
AND NORTH.  YOUR ORDERS ARE TO PROCEED TO THE MLF COMMANDED 
ARTILLERY EMPLACEMENTS AND NEUTRALIZE ALL ENEMY MLRS 
PLATFORMS.  

ALL MLF MBTS AND CFVS THAT MAY BE ON PATROL WITHIN THE DESIGNATED 
